{"channelId":"UCxAV_IrcapJEHCyufrH0LuQ","row":["Crano",2440000,"On this channel, you'll find no-commentary gameplay videos, recorded in 4K at 60 fps and presented with the highest possible visual quality. Each recording aims to respect and accurately reflect the experience as intended by the game's creator, without omitting important elements that could affect the narrative or gameplay.\n\nI focus on Roblox games, indie titles, and other immersive experiences, making sure to fully play through each game one or two times before recording in order to deliver a clear, direct, and uninterrupted walkthrough.\n\nIn addition, the titles, descriptions, and subtitles of each video are professionally translated into more than 20 languages, allowing players from around the world to enjoy each experience in their own language.\n\nThe profile picture and banner for this channel were created by the artist @Nice_Sadness.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxAV_IrcapJEHCyufrH0LuQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxAV_IrcapJEHCyufrH0LuQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:59.587Z","channelId":"UCxAV_IrcapJEHCyufrH0LuQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e870cf99a83a4778e91d57ace2e571f126f72139ce89652d8ee8f9c58c84583d","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"938774fd5ee66d4826f87217f1017801118a794d13fefd03ccde42c456ab6e86"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxAV_IrcapJEHCyufrH0LuQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:59.587Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxAV_IrcapJEHCyufrH0LuQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2440000,"raw":"2.44M subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxAV_IrcapJEHCyufrH0LuQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:59.587Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":true,